I ain't doin it!

This project is fully "put on hold" (cancelled). The Google API sucks,
and its documentation just makes matters worse. It was fine enough
until it got to the point where i had to work with OAuth. It's too
complicated. Thanks Google!

You can still use this to get the duration of a public YouTube
playlist, but i'm not gonna try to make getting the duration of your
actual Watch Later work. I've laid out everything else, you can try
doing that yourself if you really want to. If you do that, maybe
submit a patch! :)

As for me, maybe at some point if i really want to i'll make this into
a browser extension that just reads the content of the page. That way
i won't have to mess with APIs and API keys and all that crap. I dunno
why i didn't think of that earlier.
